# STAGING IMAGE VARIANT ONLY (regalia-kms-dx7.14): regalia-staging-sshd.service's whole configuration (Debian's
# /etc/ssh/sshd_config is not read). sshd keeps the FIRST value it reads for a keyword, so the settings below win over
# the same keywords in the per-host Include at the end. That alone does NOT hold for a Match block, whose settings do
# apply to the connections it matches. So the Include may hold ONLY ListenAddress and AllowUsers (this host's address,
# and an AllowUsers naming the staging management net, from /var): regalia-staging-sshd.service's first ExecStartPre,
# sshd-dropins-check.sh, refuses to start on any other keyword, Match included.
HostKey /var/lib/regalia-staging/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
AuthorizedKeysFile /var/lib/regalia-staging/authorized_keys
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
StrictModes yes
UsePAM no
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserEnvironment no
Banner /usr/lib/regalia-staging/banner
Include /var/lib/regalia-staging/sshd_config.d/*.conf
